    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Quillsen are proud to present this stunning 2 bedroom 2 bathroom apartment in The Green Development, Malahide. Situated in the heart of Malahide Village with all its amenities on the doorstep. \n \nThe accommodation in this stylish apartment comprises of entrance hall, open plan kitchen / living / dining area with access to a large East facing terrace overlooking the courtyard, 2 double bedrooms with master en-suite and a family bathroom. \n \nThis property has many special features such as under floor heating in both bathrooms, feature wooden flooring through the hallway and living room, double glazed windows and designated car parking spaces in the secure underground car park. Lift to all floors.\n \nNo. 1 presents a rare opportunity to acquire a property within this sought after development of just 45 apartments in the very heart of Malahide with a host of amenities on its doorstep including Malahide Dart station, excellent schools, a variety of sports clubs, award winning restaurants and boutique shops.\n \nViewing of this fantastic property comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 2.98m (9'9\") x 1.22m (4'0\")\nThis spacious L-shaped room features attractive wood-effect laminate flooring, offering a versatile layout with ample space for both relaxation and everyday living.\n\nKitchen/Lounge/Dining Room - 7.51m (24'8\") x 4.14m (13'7\")\nOpen-plan living and dining area with a spacious, contemporary kitchen, finished to an exceptionally high standard. The kitchen features integrated worktop surfaces and a matching splashback, while the living area benefits from a stylish gas fireplace. High-quality tiled flooring and feature wood-effect laminate flooring add to the elegant finish throughout. French doors open onto a generous sun terrace overlooking the beautifully maintained grounds, creating an ideal space for indoor-outdoor living and entertaining.\n\nBedroom - 3.26m (10'8\") x 3.44m (11'3\")\nThe property also benefits from feature wood-effect laminate flooring and an excellent range of built-in wardrobes, providing generous storage while maintaining a clean, contemporary aesthetic throughout.\n\nBedroom - 3.6m (11'10\") x 3.15m (10'4\")\nThe bedroom features attractive wood-effect laminate flooring and benefits from built-in wardrobes, providing excellent storage and a bright, uncluttered living space.\n\nBathroom - 2.04m (6'8\") x 2.43m (8'0\")\nThe family bathroom comprises a bath with overhead shower, WC and wash hand basin. Finished with tiled flooring and partially tiled walls, the room offers a practical and well-presented space suitable for everyday use.\n\nHotpress - 2.03m (6'8\") x 0.98m (3'3\")\nWalk-In storage with want tank/immersion. Feature wooden laminate flooring.\n\nEnsuite - 1.58m (5'2\") x 1.69m (5'7\")\nThe bathroom is finished to a high standard and comprises a walk-in shower, WC and wash hand basin. Stylish tiled flooring and a fully tiled corner shower enhance the contemporary design, while a heated chrome towel rail provides additional comfort and practicality.\n\nStorage Press - 0.8m (2'7\") x 1m (3'3\")\nA spacious storage cupboard with double doors opens onto the hallway, offering excellent additional storage. The area is finished with feature wood-effect laminate flooring and built-in shelving for added practicality and organisation.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Malahide Village location </li><li> 2 designated car spaces in the underground car park </li><li> Lift to all floors </li><li> Large sun terrace over looking the grounds </li><li> Feature Barn Oak Laminate to Include Acoustic Underlay </li><li> Granite work surface in the kitchen and integrated appliances </li><li> Gas heating, with gas fire and double glazed windows </li><li> Underfloor electric heating in bathroom and ensuite </li><li> Excellent storage with large walking in immersion press and separate closet </li><li> Ex show apartment - viewing highly recommended</li></ul>"
      },
